        ],
        "name": "DogeDesigner",
        "text": "BREAKING: Vietnam’s Hai Phong government partners with Starlink to bring FREE internet to remote islands.\n\nThe pilot includes 10 Starlink terminals, with FPT handling deployment and technical support: 6 in Cat Hai and 4 in Bach Long Vi.\n\nThe connections will support government services, tourism, disaster response and search-and-rescue, providing a vital backup when storms disrupt ground networks.",
