        "text": "Introducing The Cheeky Pint Benchmark.\n\nWe made our intern watch every episode of Cheeky Pint to bring you this breakdown of pints drank by guests to the nearest sixth.\n\nCongratulations to @elonmusk who is currently in the lead with three full pints of Guinness.",
