      "text": "i'm seriously considering switching full-time over to grok bot.\n\nit's the closest thing i've found to hiring a real jarvis. i basically run a one-person company now.\n\n62 agents. 29 scheduled routines. they write my morning newsletter, pull my market news and audit their own team for duplicate work.\n\n[here is every grok bot that i run ]\n\n@bot",
